      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "南宋年间，秦桧把持朝政，派遣麾下缇骑四处镇压抗金义士。七里铺发生一起惨案，金国使者等四十一人遇害，唯一幸存的文官沈放因此被怀疑是凶手。缇骑统领袁寒亭奉命追查，而下落不明的二十八万两白银也引来各路江湖人士。众人齐聚驿站，试图从看似手无缚鸡之力的沈放身上找到答案，却始终无法将他拿下，反而接连有高手离奇丧命。面对朝廷追捕与江湖围堵，沈放声称凶案另有其人，而随着各方势力相互猜忌、不断交锋，这桩血案背后的疑团也变得越来越复杂……",
          "runtime": 97,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Sous la dynastie des Song du Sud, deux individus — le lettré Shen Fang et le chevalier errant Luo Han — dérobent une somme considérable en argent au haut fonctionnaire Qin Hui afin de soutenir les rebelles luttant contre les Jin ; ils mettent au point un vaste stratagème pour contrer la garde impériale et rallier à leur cause des personnes issues de tous horizons.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "A Better Jianghu"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Dois indivíduos, o estudioso Shen Fang e o cavaleiro andante Luo Han, roubam uma enorme quantia de prata do oficial Qin Hui para apoiar os rebeldes anti-Jin, arquitetando uma grande farsa para combater a guarda imperial e mobilizar pessoas de todas as classes sociais para a sua causa durante a Dinastia Song do Sul.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "A Better Jiangh"
        }
      }
